build/

## Scratch files a work session leaves in the working copy. The local file-safety policy on
## this machine refuses deletions, so they are moved into build\scratch\ rather than removed.
## They are not part of the product and can be deleted by hand from there.
build/scratch/
build/legacy/

## The stray solution file the first `dotnet new sln` left behind has been moved to
## build\legacy\StoreFlow.slnx, so a bare `dotnet build` in the root is no longer ambiguous.
## There is deliberately NO `*.slnx` rule here: if one ever appears in the root again it must
## show up in `git status` rather than hide itself.

## The stray zero-byte file `0.26.0` that a shell redirect left in the repository root. The local
## file-safety policy on this machine refuses deletions AND refuses moves inside the workspace,
## so it cannot be moved into build\scratch\ like the others. It is covered here instead, so it
## stays out of the index; the file itself is empty and can be deleted by hand.
/0.26.0
